M, 4G), hasta:9,8 h<\/li><li><strong>Conectividad<\/strong><\/li><li>Bluetooth:5.0<\/li><li>Clavija para auriculares:3,5 mm<\/li><li>Conexi\u00f3n USB:USB Type-C<\/li><li><strong>Bater\u00eda y carga<\/strong><\/li><li>Carga: USB Type-C<\/li><li>de su bater\u00eda:1450 mAh1 Extra\u00edble<\/li><li>Duraci\u00f3n de la bater\u00eda: Hasta 9,8 h de tiempo de conversaci\u00f3n en las mismas condiciones del laboratorio.<\/li><li><strong>Memoria y almacenamiento<\/strong><\/li><li>Admite tarjetas microSD de hasta:32 GB<\/li><li>Almacenamiento interno:128 MB2<\/li><li>RAM:64 MB<\/li><li>Plataforma<\/li><li>CPU: Unisoc T107<\/li><li><strong>Sistema operativo<\/strong><\/li><li>Sistema operativo:S30+&#8203;<\/li><li><strong>Audio<\/strong><\/li><li>Altavoces:1<\/li><li>Micr\u00f3fonos:1<\/li><li>Receptor de radio FM:FM Radio (Wired\/Wireless)<\/li><li><strong>Redes<\/strong><\/li><li>Bandas de red (GSM):3,5,8<\/li><li>Bandas de red (LTE):VN\/MM\/NP: LTE: 1,3,5,8 EU + AMEA + Rest of APAC:1, 3, 5, 7, 8, 20, 28, 38, 40, 41(full band) IN + CN: 1, 3, 5, 8, 28, 38, 39, 40, 41<\/li><li>Bandas de red (WCDMA):1, 5, 8<\/li><li>Redes:GSM\/GPRS 900\/1800, WCDMA, LTE Cat1<\/li><li>Tama\u00f1o de la SIM:4FF+4FF<\/li><li>Velocidad de red m\u00e1xima:4G<\/li><li><strong>En la caja<\/strong><\/li><li>Gu\u00eda de inicio r\u00e1pido<\/li><li>Folleto de seguridad<\/li><li>Bater\u00eda extra\u00edble<\/li><li>Gu\u00eda del usuario<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"NOKIA","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":60.77,"unit_price_tax":60.77,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"SmartPhones y Moviles","sub_category":"Tel\u00e9fonos B\u00e1sicos","quantity":0,"brand":"NOKIA",